# build output
# NOTE: dist/ is intentionally committed on this fork (unlike upstream) so
# that `npm install -g <user>/copilot-api` works. npm's global installer does
# not reliably install devDependencies or run build-dependent lifecycle
# scripts for git dependencies, so a pre-built dist/main.js avoids requiring
# a build step (and the bun toolchain) at install time. Regenerate with
# `npm run build` and commit the result whenever src/ changes.
